31573,24.2,2021,64,107,26],[31872,14.2,1966,63,114,23],[31873,12.4,1966,58,111,27]],"links":[["Jefferson County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/montana/jefferson-county"],["ARC or PLC in Jefferson County","/arc-plc/montana/jefferson-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Jefferson County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 16 grids. January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, June to July hit 64% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 30971 had its driest year in 2021 at 58% of normal.</p>"}
